This is a placeholder for the DMI (BYOND Dream Maker Image) file.
Replace this file with your actual disease_compendium.dmi icon using BYOND's icon editor or any DMI editor.

Expected icon states:
- book3_0 (closed book icon)
- book3_1 (open book page 1)
- book3_2 (open book page 2)
etc.

You can create DMI files using:
1. BYOND Dream Maker (built-in icon editor)
2. Online DMI editors
3. Tools like Pistonwhip or other community DMI editors
